    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a Medieval Tavern Simulator where you serve delicious products to the villagers, made from your ingredients grown with love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and manage your place the way you like it, take care of your crops and animals, engage in relaxing fun activities, explore the world and scary mysterious dungeons, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/bf2d8395dbba2810fd7e94aec3ebad4a.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/bf2d8395dbba2810fd7e94aec3ebad4a.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Tavern the way you like it with a great variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/4f661e7b4c4302f71f154467c1c6a78d.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/4f661e7b4c4302f71f154467c1c6a78d.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your crops and take good care of them to improve your harvests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/52966047de0bf170898422c79d67952d.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/52966047de0bf170898422c79d67952d.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fresh products from your garden and farm to prepare delicious dishes and serve drinks to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/912282dfa4ab5b6403b63f6fc3ef8500.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/912282dfa4ab5b6403b63f6fc3ef8500.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through mysterious dungeons in search of loot to sell in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a Medieval Tavern Simulator where you serve delicious products to the villagers, made from your ingredients grown with love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and manage your place the way you like it, take care of your crops and animals, engage in relaxing fun activities, explore the world and scary mysterious dungeons, and much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/bf2d8395dbba2810fd7e94aec3ebad4a.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/bf2d8395dbba2810fd7e94aec3ebad4a.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Tavern the way you like it with a great variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/4f661e7b4c4302f71f154467c1c6a78d.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/4f661e7b4c4302f71f154467c1c6a78d.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your crops and take good care of them to improve your harvests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/52966047de0bf170898422c79d67952d.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/52966047de0bf170898422c79d67952d.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fresh products from your garden and farm to prepare delicious dishes and serve drinks to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/912282dfa4ab5b6403b63f6fc3ef8500.poster.avif?t=1754590561\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/912282dfa4ab5b6403b63f6fc3ef8500.webp?t=1754590561\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through mysterious dungeons in search of loot to sell in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>",
    "short_description": "A Medieval Tavern and Merchant Simulator with dungeon exploration. Decorate and customize your place. Grow and cook delicious things and serve them to your customers. Open an inter-dimensional portal and explore dark places, then sell your loot for a good price!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French",
